        </object>
        <object id="clear-e" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot;&gt;ClearTransientSpeedForFinalBlock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;实体按净被动 X 是否朝阻挡方向判断；成立时让 EffectState 清空限时速度与动态累计速度。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;不撤销来源；不修改已经冻结的 motionFrame 或本帧请求。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="../../Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Base/BasicEntity.cs" tooltip="Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Base/BasicEntity.cs · ClearTransientSpeedForFinalBlock">
