        <object id="reconcile" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot;&gt;4.7 · ReconcileContactForceLinks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;对比 previous / current，撤销本帧未成立的旧有向关系。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;交换集合：current 成为下一帧 previous。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="../../Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Mgr/PhysicsSolverMgr.cs" tooltip="Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Mgr/PhysicsSolverMgr.cs · ReconcileContactForceLinks">
